# TASK 2: Case Study Analysis

## Selected Company: Moderna, Inc.

### 1. Biotechnology Innovation & Product
Moderna ka buniyaadi innovation unka **mRNA (messenger RNA) platform** hai. Yeh technology body ke cells ko instructions deti hai taake woh khud bimariyon se larne wali proteins generate kar sakein. Unka sabse famous product COVID-19 Vaccine (Spikevax) hai.

### 2. Applications & Challenges
* **Applications:** Infectious diseases (Flu, RSV), Oncology (Cancer immunotherapies), aur rare genetic mutations ka ilaaj.
* **Challenges:** mRNA molecule ko body mein safely deliver karne ke liye Lipid Nanoparticles (LNP) technology design karna aur cold-chain maintenance check rakhna.

### 3. Market Impact
Moderna ne medical industry ko hamesha ke liye badal diya kyunke unhone sabse kam waqt mein vaccine banakar dikhayi. Is se company ki market value billions of dollars tak pohanchi aur mRNA technology ko global validation mili.
